WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.450
A radioactive sample halves in a fixed time: its half-life.

2
00:00:05.027 --> 00:00:10.102
A hundred iodine one thirty one nuclei. The half-life is eight days.

3
00:00:11.972 --> 00:00:14.772
After eight days, about half are left.

4
00:00:16.499 --> 00:00:20.149
After sixteen days, about a quarter: half of the half.

5
00:00:20.925 --> 00:00:26.075
Which nucleus goes next is random, but the sample halves every eight days.
